			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4316918">
									

<p>This is an absolutely wonderful first SCP, and you've done an excellent job of tapping into the modern zeitgeist of an uncertain future, impending doom and consequential head-in-the-sandism of the general populace and burn out of activists.</p>
<p>The SCP itself works wonderfully as well, since it's legitimately unclear if reversing entropy would make life impossible or make us all immortal. It's believable that enough people in power would think it was worth the risk, and that most people would choose to accept that rather than risk wasting what could be their final days.</p>
<p>I look forward to reading more by you in the future!</p>

